{% comment %}
================================================================================
  WHY THERMAWRAP — "10 Gründe" Landingpage
  Eigenständige Section, EIN durchgehender Grund-Abschnitt (keine Angle-Blöcke).
  Jeder einzelne Grund ist konkret und deckt in Summe alle drei Marketing-
  Angles ab (Nighttime Pain Relief, Wasted Money on Junk, Nurse Shift Relief),
  ohne sie als separate Kapitel zu labeln.
  Bildquelle je Grund: Theme-Editor Bild-Upload (Block-Einstellung) mit
  automatischem Icon-Fallback, falls kein Bild gesetzt ist.
  Visuelle Identität 1:1 an sections/kwefi-template.liquid angeglichen.
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Manrope:wght@500;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap');

.wt{
  --accent:#DC2626;
  --accent-deep:#7C1D1D;
  --accent-soft:rgba(220,38,38,0.10);
  --green:#16a34a;
  --green-soft:rgba(22,163,74,0.10);
  --bg:#F8FAF8;
  --bg-soft:#EFF4F0;
  --ink:#111111;
  --tx:#1A1A1A;
  --tx-dim:#6B7280;
  --card:#F2F6F3;
  --card-line:#E5E5E5;
  --display:'Anton',Impact,sans-serif;
  --head:'Manrope',sans-serif;
  --sans:'Inter',-apple-system,sans-serif;
  --mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;

  font-family:var(--sans);
  color:var(--ink);
  background:var(--bg);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  line-height:1.55;
  width:100vw;max-width:100vw;
  margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw);
}
.wt *,.wt *::before,.wt *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
.wt img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}

/* Hide currency/search/account/cart/logo in the header, but only on pages
   that contain this section — leaves the header untouched everywhere else.
   The announcement bar is intentionally NOT in this list — kept visible. */
body:has(.wt) header-actions,
body:has(.wt) .search-action,
body:has(.wt) dropdown-localization-component,
body:has(.wt) .dropdown-localization,
body:has(.wt) .header-logo{
  display:none !important;
}

/* ====== HERO (editorial style: left-aligned, full-width, serif headline, optional byline) ====== */
.wt-hero{padding:48px 24px 24px}
.wt-hero-inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;text-align:left}
.wt-h1{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;color:var(--ink);font-size:40px;margin:0;text-wrap:balance}
.wt-h1 em{color:var(--accent);font-style:normal}
.wt-byline{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}
.wt-byline-avatar{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--card-line)}
.wt-byline-avatar img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.wt-byline-text{text-align:left;line-height:1.3}
.wt-byline-label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--tx-dim);font-weight:600}
.wt-byline-name{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}
.wt-hero-divider{border-top:1px solid var(--card-line);margin:22px 0}
.wt-sub{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--tx);line-height:1.65;max-width:760px;margin:0}
.wt-sub p{margin:0}
.wt-sub strong{font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}

/* ====== REASONS LIST ====== */
.wt-list-sec{background:var(--bg-soft);padding:64px 24px 80px}
.wt-list{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}

.wt-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--card-line);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(17,17,17,0.05)}
.wt-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(17,17,17,0.10)}
.wt-card .wt-frame{order:1}
.wt-card .wt-copy{order:2}
.wt-card.is-reverse .wt-frame{order:2}
.wt-card.is-reverse .wt-copy{order:1}

.wt-frame{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:var(--accent-soft)}
.wt-frame img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.wt-frame-icon{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.wt-frame-icon svg{width:56px;height:56px;color:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.6}

.wt-copy{padding:40px 44px;display:flex;align-items:center;align-self:center}
.wt-card:has(.wt-acc[open]) .wt-copy{align-self:start}
.wt-acc{width:100%}
.wt-acc summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:18px}
.wt-acc summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.wt-step-num{flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);background:var(--green-soft);border:1px solid rgba(22,163,74,0.3);border-radius:100px;padding:6px 16px}
.wt-summary-body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;width:100%}
.wt-heading{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:800;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink);margin:0;text-align:center}
.wt-plus{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--tx-dim);font-size:24px;line-height:1;transition:transform .2s,color .15s}
.wt-acc[open] .wt-plus{transform:rotate(45deg);color:var(--green)}
.wt-acc-body{padding:16px 0 0 0;text-align:left}
.wt-text{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tx);line-height:1.65}
.wt-text p{margin:0 0 10px}
.wt-text p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.wt-text strong{font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}

/* ====== CLOSING SUMMARY BOX ====== */
.wt-closing{max-width:1080px;margin:8px auto 0;background:var(--green-soft);border-left:4px solid var(--green);border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;padding:28px 32px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(17,17,17,0.05)}
.wt-closing p{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--tx);line-height:1.7}
.wt-closing strong{font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}

/* ====== SHARED CTA BUTTON / TRUST LINE ====== */
.wt-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 32px;border-radius:100px;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 12px 32px -12px rgba(220,38,38,0.45);transition:transform .15s ease,background .15s ease}
.wt-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:var(--accent-deep)}
.wt-cta::after{content:"\2192";font-size:18px}
.wt-cta-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:6px 18px;margin-top:20px;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:700;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)}

/* ====== CLOSING OFFER CARD ====== */
.wt-offer-sec{background:var(--bg-soft);border-top:1px solid var(--card-line);padding:72px 24px 80px}
.wt-offer-wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.wt-offer-badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:800;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:100px;position:relative;z-index:2;margin-bottom:-20px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -8px rgba(22,163,74,0.55)}
.wt-offer-card{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--card-line);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 16px 44px rgba(17,17,17,0.08);padding:44px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;text-align:left}
.wt-offer-img{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:16px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--card-line);overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.wt-offer-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.wt-offer-img-icon svg{width:64px;height:64px;color:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.4}
.wt-offer-h{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 14px}
.wt-offer-text{font-size:15px;color:var(--tx);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:26px}
.wt-offer-text p{margin:0 0 10px}
.wt-offer-text p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.wt-offer-text strong{font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}
.wt-promo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--green-soft);border:1px solid rgba(22,163,74,0.35);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:22px}
.wt-promo-icon svg{width:17px;height:17px;color:var(--green);flex-shrink:0}
.wt-promo-text{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;color:var(--ink)}
.wt-promo-text strong{color:var(--green);font-weight:900}
.wt-offer-body .wt-cta{width:auto}
.wt-offer-body .wt-cta-trust{justify-content:flex-start}

@media(max-width:860px){
  .wt-hero{padding:32px 20px 18px}
  .wt-byline{margin-top:16px}
  .wt-h1{font-size:28px}
  .wt-hero-divider{margin:18px 0}
  .wt-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .wt-card .wt-frame{order:1 !important}
  .wt-card .wt-copy{order:2 !important}
  /* aspect-ratio:1/1 from the base rule already keeps images square on mobile */
  .wt-copy{padding:28px 24px}
  .wt-heading{font-size:17px}
  .wt-acc-body{padding-left:0;margin-top:2px}
  .wt-closing{padding:20px 20px 20px 22px;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0}
  .wt-closing p{font-size:13.5px}
  .wt-offer-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:28px;text-align:center;gap:24px}
  .wt-offer-img{max-width:220px;margin:0 auto}
  .wt-offer-h{font-size:23px}
  .wt-offer-body .wt-cta-trust{justify-content:center}
  .wt-promo{justify-content:center}
  .wt-offer-badge{font-size:11px;padding:8px 16px}
}
</style>

<div class="wt">

  <section class="wt-hero">
    <div class="wt-hero-inner">
      <h1 class="wt-h1">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1>
      {% if section.settings.show_byline and section.settings.byline_name != blank %}
        <div class="wt-byline">
          {% if section.settings.byline_avatar != blank %}
            <div class="wt-byline-avatar">
              <img src="{{ section.settings.byline_avatar | image_url: width: 80 }}" alt="{{ section.settings.byline_name | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40">
            </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="wt-byline-text">
            <div class="wt-byline-label">Geschrieben von</div>
            <div class="wt-byline-name">{{ section.settings.byline_name }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <div class="wt-hero-divider"></div>
        <div class="wt-sub">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wt-list-sec">
    <div class="wt-list">
      {% for block in section.blocks %}
        {% assign is_even = forloop.index | modulo: 2 %}
        <div class="wt-card{% if is_even == 0 %} is-reverse{% endif %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="wt-frame">
            {% if block.settings.image != blank %}
              <img src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}">
            {% else %}
              <div class="wt-frame-icon">
                {% case block.type %}
                  {% when 'reason_1' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 15.5A8.5 8.5 0 1 1 8.5 4a7 7 0 0 0 11.5 11.5z"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_2' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 7h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v1"/><path d="M7 17h6a4 4 0 0 0 4-4"/><line x1="3" y1="3" x2="21" y2="21"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_3' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="1.3"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="1.3"/><circle cx="17" cy="7" r="1.3"/><circle cx="7" cy="12" r="1.3"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.3"/><circle cx="17" cy="12" r="1.3"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1.3"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.3"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="1.3"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_4' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M4.2 4.2l2.1 2.1M17.7 17.7l2.1 2.1M3 12h3M18 12h3M4.2 19.8l2.1-2.1M17.7 6.3l2.1-2.1"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_5' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="18" height="10" rx="2"/><line x1="22" y1="10" x2="22" y2="14"/><path d="M8 9.5 6 12.5h2.5L7 16"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_6' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="7"/><path d="M12 9v4l3 2"/><path d="M5 3 3 5M19 3l2 2"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_7' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="8.5" cy="9" r="3.2"/><circle cx="15.5" cy="9" r="3.2"/><path d="M2.5 19c.6-3 2.8-5 6-5s5.4 2 6 5M9.5 19c.6-3 2.8-5 6-5s5.4 2 6 5"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_8' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="4.5"/><path d="M12 3v2.5M4.5 8 6.3 9.6M19.5 8l-1.8 1.6M2 19h20"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_9' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8l-5 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
                  {% when 'reason_10' %}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v7c0 5-3.5 8-8 10-4.5-2-8-5-8-10V5z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
                {% endcase %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="wt-copy">
            <details class="wt-acc"{% if block.type == 'reason_1' or block.type == 'reason_10' %} open{% endif %}>
              <summary>
                <span class="wt-step-num">Grund {% if forloop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ forloop.index }}</span>
                <span class="wt-summary-body">
                  <span class="wt-heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</span>
                  <span class="wt-plus">+</span>
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="wt-acc-body">
                <div class="wt-text">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if section.settings.closing_text != blank %}
      <div class="wt-closing">{{ section.settings.closing_text }}</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="wt-offer-sec">
    <div class="wt-offer-wrap">
      {% if section.settings.offer_badge != blank %}
        <span class="wt-offer-badge">{{ section.settings.offer_badge }}</span>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="wt-offer-card">
        <div class="wt-offer-img">
          {% if section.settings.offer_image != blank %}
            <img src="{{ section.settings.offer_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ section.settings.offer_heading | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ section.settings.offer_image.width }}" height="{{ section.settings.offer_image.height }}">
          {% else %}
            <div class="wt-offer-img-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 7h12l1 13H5z"/><path d="M9 7a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="wt-offer-body">
          <h2 class="wt-offer-h">{{ section.settings.offer_heading }}</h2>
          <div class="wt-offer-text">{{ section.settings.offer_text }}</div>
          {% unless customer and customer.orders_count > 0 %}
            <div class="wt-promo">
              <span class="wt-promo-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 12v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7"/><path d="M2 7h20v5H2z"/><path d="M12 22V7"/>
                  <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"/><path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="wt-promo-text">Neukunden erhalten <strong>20%</strong> mit Code <strong>WILLKOMMEN20</strong></span>
            </div>
          {% endunless %}
          <a href="{{ section.settings.offer_cta_url }}" class="wt-cta">{{ section.settings.offer_cta_label }}</a>
          <div class="wt-cta-trust">&#10003; Kostenloser Versand in ganz Europa &middot; &#10003; 90-Tage-Geld-zurück-Garantie</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Warum ThermaWrap",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "why-thermawrap-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Headline",
      "default": "10 Gründe, warum ThermaWrap das nächtliche Kribbeln stoppt, bevor es zum Dauerzustand wird"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Unterüberschrift",
      "default": "<p>Auf den ersten Blick sieht ThermaWrap aus wie eine gewöhnliche Wärmebandage. <strong>Ist es nicht.</strong> Die Kombination aus 660nm &amp; 850nm Rotlicht, Wärme und Vibration ist auf 20 Minuten am Tag ausgelegt – <strong>gebaut, um zu halten</strong>, statt in der Schublade mit den Produkten zu landen, die nie eingehalten haben, was sie versprachen. Diese 10 Gründe zeigen, worauf es dabei ankommt.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Autor-Byline (optional)"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_byline",
      "label": "Byline unter dem Titel anzeigen",
      "info": "Bleibt auch bei aktiviertem Haken unsichtbar, solange kein Name eingetragen ist.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "byline_name",
      "label": "Name",
      "info": "Trage hier eine echte Person ein, die inhaltlich für den Text steht — kein Platzhalter."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "byline_avatar",
      "label": "Foto (optional)"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Abschluss-Zusammenfassung"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "closing_text",
      "label": "Zusammenfassungs-Box (unter Grund 10)",
      "default": "<p>Wenn du bis hierhin gelesen hast, ist eines klar geworden: Schienen, Spritzen und Billig-Wraps kümmern sich um Symptome, aber keines bringt gezielt die Durchblutung zurück, die deinem Nerv fehlt. Genau deshalb kommt das Kribbeln immer wieder – ob nachts, nach der Schicht oder beim nächsten Griff nach der Kaffeetasse. <strong>ThermaWrap setzt genau da an, wo diese Lösungen aufhören – und mit 90 Tagen Geld-zurück-Garantie trägst du dabei kein Risiko.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Abschluss-Angebot"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_badge",
      "label": "Badge über der Karte",
      "default": "🎁 Aktuelles Angebot"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "offer_image",
      "label": "Produktbild (links)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_heading",
      "label": "Überschrift",
      "default": "Sichere dir ThermaWrap zu deinem Vorteilspreis"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "offer_text",
      "label": "Angebotstext",
      "default": "<p>Als Single für <strong>89,99€</strong> statt 129,00€ oder als Duo-Set für <strong>139,99€</strong> statt 258,00€ inklusive Bonus-Geschenken. Beide Optionen mit <strong>kostenlosem Versand in ganz Europa</strong> und <strong>90 Tage Geld-zurück-Garantie</strong> – merkst du keinen Unterschied, bekommst du dein Geld zurück.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "offer_cta_url",
      "label": "Button-Link (zum Kaufbereich)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_cta_label",
      "label": "Button-Text",
      "default": "Jetzt ThermaWrap sichern"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "reason_1",
      "name": "Grund 1",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
